{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Terraspace! Here you have to go on an exciting journey through the galaxy and build a spaceship that will help you move to another planet. But this is not just a construction game \u2014 it's a whole universe where you can show your skills as a strategist and engineer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535330/extras/6e1800eea562f93a4d330fd5177205f4.poster.avif?t=1772902523\" width=800 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535330/extras/6e1800eea562f93a4d330fd5177205f4.webm?t=1772902523\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535330/extras/6e1800eea562f93a4d330fd5177205f4.mp4?t=1772902523\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game &quot;Terraspace&quot; you will be engaged in the construction of equipment that will allow you to extract the necessary resources: food, water, electricity and other consumables. You will have to plan your actions carefully to provide your team with everything necessary for survival in space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But your main goal is not to destroy the astronauts and build a spaceship that can transport you to another planet. To do this, you will need to create new designs and collect resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535330/extras/df340da685f6e0a456252ccf18158c7d.avif?t=1772902523\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535330/extras_big/df340da685f6e0a456252ccf18158c7d.avif?t=1772902523 width=800 height=196 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features of the game &quot;Terraspace&quot;:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* A variety of technologies and designs to create.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Addictive and addictive gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Beautiful graphics and atmospheric soundtrack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready for the most exciting journey of your life? Then welcome to the game &quot;Terraspace&quot;, where every step you take will matter, and every decision will affect the outcome of the entire mission!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Start","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3535330/ac17d80c29a6b59926fc6b1ba0a7e31e8826346b.jpg"},{"name":"Together is fun","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3535330/e9a3cc182e6aaeecd0390221f850c1975c686fb2.jpg"},{"name":"Karg","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3535330/e2082ee9c572d9544555966f1c5ec6412fdf4992.jpg"},{"name":"Crip","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3535330/9e68be4f6a02126a47788d6f6569b9546ce2a65e.jpg"},{"name":"Nawk","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3535330/103a1742b2654354eda2128bebb139258da06bcb.jpg"},{"name":"Vok","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3535330/19c5a947b1440036068df8010cba4772c415947e.jpg"},{"name":"Give me more","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3535330/f1ca13104b8cccbd0f69c30a102c5fccbb843bf0.jpg"},{"name":"Not so fast","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3535330/9a58d49d2a9d7b7567fc977f6500aef9997a8155.jpg"},{"name":"Technologies","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3535330/65e0ac505da8fd3d55aaa5a444d6b22b48aa96ea.jpg"},{"name":"Cold night","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3535330/91e30bfa5404dac8dad8ebc03f