nt that will allow you to extract the necessary resources: food, water, electricity and other consumables. You will have to plan your actions carefully to provide your team with everything necessary for survival in space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But your main goal is not to destroy the astronauts and build a spaceship that can transport you to another planet. To do this, you will need to create new designs and collect resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535330/extras/df340da685f6e0a456252ccf18158c7d.avif?t=1772902523\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535330/extras_big/df340da685f6e0a456252ccf18158c7d.avif?t=1772902523 width=800 height=196 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features of the game &quot;Terraspace&quot;:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* A variety of technologies and designs to create.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Addictive and addictive gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Beautiful graphics and atmospheric soundtrack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready for the most exciting journey of your life? Then welcome to the game &quot;Terraspace&quot;, where every step you take will matter, and every decision will affect the outcome of the entire mission!</p>","developers":["Black Apple"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535330/5fc62a33f3e2507937b2047f60da765153afd82b/header.jpg?t=1772902523","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}